<title>USA: Checkmate Electronics Q1 full results.</title>
<headline>Checkmate Electronics Q1 full results.</headline>
<dateline>ROSWELL, Ga. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended</p>
<p>					    March 31,</p>
<p>					   1997	  1996</p>
<p>				    (Audited)   (Audited)</p>
<p> Net revenues			$9,506	$7,920</p>
<p> Costs of goods sold		5,513	 4,762</p>
<p> Gross profit			 3,993	 3,158</p>
<p>Operating expenses:</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>   administrative		   2,675	 2,107</p>
<p>  Research and development	  234	   149</p>
<p>  Depreciation and amortization   168	   140</p>
<p> Total operating expenses	 3,077	 2,396</p>
<p> Operating income		     916	   762</p>
<p> Interest income, net		  85	    80</p>
<p> Income before income taxes     1,001	   842</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes	 340	   312</p>
<p> Net income			     661	   530</p>
<p> Net income per share		0.12	  0.10</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p>  shares outstanding		5,697	 5,567</p>
<p>(Dollars in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>Note: Full company name is Checkmate Electronics Inc.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
